cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "lidar-terrain-arcgis-tools: ArcGIS Pro toolbox for LiDAR-derived topographic factors"
abstract: >-
  An ArcGIS Pro Python toolbox that derives topographic factors from DGT LiDAR elevation data
  (DEM and DSM) in batch, per area of interest. It builds per area and per cluster mosaics,
  derives slope, aspect, hillshade and curvature, computes annual solar radiation with the GPU
  RasterSolarRadiation tool, reclassifies aspect, slope and solar into suitability classes, and
  resamples the outputs. Project CRS EPSG:3763 (ETRS89 / PT-TM06).
type: software
